            "text": "theorem compact_jet_bound {E : Type} [NormedAddCommGroup E] [NormedSpace ℝ E]\n    {F : E → V} {U K : Set E} (hU : IsOpen U) (hF : ContDiffOn ℝ ∞ F U)\n    (hK : IsCompact K) (hKU : K ⊆ U) (m : ℕ) :\n    ∃ C : ℝ, 1 ≤ C ∧ ∀ x ∈ K, ‖iteratedFDeriv ℝ m F x‖ ≤ C"
